      "writtenOn": "2025-05-01T13:29:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Maybe we want to be able to build either:\n\n- as a myriad of dlls (`DAWN_BUILD_MONOLITHIC_LIBRARY\u003dFALSE`, `BUILD_SHARED_LIBS\u003dTRUE`)\n- as a single monolithic dll (`DAWN_BUILD_MONOLITHIC_LIBRARY\u003dTRUE`, `BUILD_SHARED_LIBS\u003dTRUE`)\n- as a myriad of static libs (`DAWN_BUILD_MONOLITHIC_LIBRARY\u003dFALSE`, `BUILD_SHARED_LIBS\u003dFALSE`)\n- or as a single monolithic static lib (`DAWN_BUILD_MONOLITHIC_LIBRARY\u003dTRUE`, `BUILD_SHARED_LIBS\u003dFALSE`)\n\nMonolithic shared/static libs make redistribution of prebuilt lib much easier I think. I\u0027m not sure how the myriad of dlls is useful, but why not.",
